---
// Architectural Cable System Overview Component
---

<section class="section-spacing" style="background: #F8FAFC; border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0; border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" style="text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 3rem auto;">
      <span style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0284C7; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; display: block;">
        SYSTEM OVERVIEW
      </span>
      <h2 style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem); font-weight: 900; color: #0F172A; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        Anatomy of Invisible Grills
      </h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #64748B; line-height: 1.6;">
        A closer look at the materials and structure used in residential invisible safety grill installations.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; align-items: center;">
      <!-- Visual Engineering Breakdown Card -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; border-radius: 20px; padding: 2rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);">
        <div style="position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; background: #E0F2FE; border-bottom-left-radius: 14px; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #0284C7; font-weight: 700;">
          CABLE & PROFILE STRUCTURE
        </div>

        <h3 style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          Component Breakdown
        </h3>

        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem;">
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start;">
            <div style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: #0284C7; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; flex-shrink: 0;">1</div>
            <div>
              <h4 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 0.2rem;">Protective Outer Casing</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;">
                Transparent protective casing shields the wire from outdoor weathering and dust accumulation while ensuring smooth handling.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start;">
            <div style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: #0284C7; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; flex-shrink: 0;">2</div>
            <div>
              <h4 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 0.2rem;">Stainless Steel Cable Core</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;">
                Wound stainless steel wire cables designed for residential balcony and window safety containment.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start;">
            <div style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: #0284C7; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; flex-shrink: 0;">3</div>
            <div>
              <h4 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 0.2rem;">Aluminium Track System</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;">
                Sturdy extruded aluminium tracks mounted into concrete perimeter walls and slabs to hold cable tension securely.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Engineering Specifications Grid -->
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.25rem;">
        <div class="arch-card" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #0284C7; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;">CABLE MATERIAL</div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">Stainless Steel</div>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;">
            Durable stainless steel wire cables suitable for outdoor residential environments.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="arch-card" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #0284C7; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;">SAFETY PURPOSE</div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">Fall Prevention</div>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;">
            Designed to help prevent accidental falls from residential balconies and windows.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="arch-card" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #0284C7; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;">ANCHORING SYSTEM</div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">Concrete Anchors</div>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;">
            Fasteners secured into concrete slabs and structural frames for steady, reliable fitting.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="arch-card" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #0284C7; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;">OPEN VIEW</div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">Uninterrupted Vistas</div>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;">
            Slim vertical or horizontal cables maintain natural airflow, daylight, and skyline vistas.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
